Source: @DISTRO_ID@-hw-legion
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: @DISTRO_HOME_URL@
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: @DISTRO_ID@-hw-legion
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: hardware support for the Lenovo Legion Pro 7 16IAX10H
 What only this laptop model needs: /etc/@DISTRO_ID@/gpu names the Intel GPU,
 to which every display output of this model is wired, as the one GPU
 Hyprland renders on, so the NVIDIA GPU can power down while nothing uses it.
 The installer installs this package when the firmware names this model.
